abstract: >-
  A prediction-level candidate database of 4,117 phage antibacterial proteins
  (depolymerases, endolysins, holins) with functional-annotation evidence,
  structural evidence, host/serotype links, in-silico substrate inference,
  novelty/transferability scores, and six-dimension ranking. Version 2.0 adds
  sequence-level protein-language-model prediction with leakage-free frozen-set
  evaluation (ESM-2 / ProtT5), strict APBS electrostatics and enrichment-based
  conservation, host–serotype linking (Kaptive/PAst), and full-library novelty
  against the entire AlphaFold DB plus dbCAN CAZyme annotation.
